Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 ffmpeg,
 libayatana-appindicator3-1
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Description: offline speech transcription with Whisper models
 Vibe transcribes audio and video on your own computer, without sending
 anything away: subtitles (SRT, VTT), text and JSON, speaker labels, many
 languages, batch files and a command line.
 .
 This is upstream's own build of Vibe 3.2.2 (MIT,
 https://github.com/thewh1teagle/vibe), repackaged after its signature was
 checked against the key in the tagged source. The source package carries
 the tagged source and the signed release.
 .
 At run time: the models (Whisper, voice activity detection, speaker
 separation) are not in the package. Vibe downloads the ones you choose from
 huggingface.co when you ask, and it can check GitHub for a newer release.
 Recognition runs on the CPU, and on the GPU through Vulkan when a Vulkan
 driver is present (vibe-server, the engine, is built on ggml).
